# Enterprise Application Guidelines
Always strictly follow the standards defined in the ENTERPRISE_STANDARDS.md file located in the root of this workspace.

Key focus areas for all AI interactions:
1. Always maintain strict separation of concerns between frontend and backend.
2. Prioritize secure, performant, and scalable code.
3. Validate and sanitize all inputs before processing.
4. Follow the Tailwind CSS utility-first approach and the established Theme System CSS variables for styling.
5. Prevent SQL injections by using parameterized queries exclusively.
6. Ensure responsive, mobile-first design for all UI components.
